+#
+# Copyright (C) 2023, Inria
+# GRAPHDECO research group, https://team.inria.fr/graphdeco
+# All rights reserved.
+#
+# This software is free for non-commercial, research and evaluation use 
+# under the terms of the LICENSE.md file.
